        Points at a page on the web app rather than straight at the App Store,
        which is what the iOS build has to do: App Store guideline 2.3.10
        disallows naming other mobile platforms inside an app, so that build
        cannot carry a Play Store link. One page for both keeps the store URLs
        in a single place and lets each app stay quiet about the other.
    -->
